silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_05_glue_as_kleisli_arrow_decomposition_step_5__step_y^inmittens_=_lambda_rec__lambda_id__lambda_qual__lambda_mea a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "The Yoneda profile of Mittens has ten incoming arrows (the ten cocone legs lambda_j) and one canonical outgoing arrow (the mediating map u to any competing cocone target). No competing cocone target VetCarePlan77 can replace Mittens as the colimit because VetCarePlan77 does not receive a unique mediating arrow from all other compatible cocones — only Mittens does." .
